    <node id="&quot;JOHNNY D&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CHARACTER"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Johnny D is a reference to Bob Bailey's role in the radio series 'Johnny Dollar', compared to his role in 'Let George Do It' by Harron68."</data>
